# Exception: the #50 H4-LARGE-N-CAUSE-1 evidence tree closes over its own
# collection logs. `RAW-HASH-CLOSURE.txt` covers the collection-attempt
# logs and the per-lane logs (they are cited evidence: run-lane.sh records
# each lane's producing executable SHA256 there, and Issue #50 section 17
# keeps attempts 1-4 archived with the defect that forced the re-run).
# A closure over files that a fresh clone cannot contain is not verifiable,
# so these logs must be tracked. Nothing else under `*.log` is affected.
!research/benchmarks/markdown-ast-update/results/h4-large-n-cause-1/**/*.log
!research/benchmarks/markdown-ast-update/results/h4-large-n-cause-1/*.log

# Research experiment raw benchmark output stays local; curated summaries
# under results/summary/ are the committed evidence.
research/experiments/experiment-0-parser-survey/results/raw/

# #33 real-workload acquisition cache: rebuildable upstream clones, not
# benchmark authority (see workloads/README.md)
research/benchmarks/markdown-ast-update/workloads/_cache/
